Awak mesti bergurau dengan saya.

83
00:07:44.214 --> 00:07:45.716
Mereka sukar dipercayai.

84
00:07:45.799 --> 00:07:46.758
orang jerkah!

85
00:07:47.926 --> 00:07:48.969
Hei, Hyeon-jun.

86
00:07:49.052 --> 00:07:50.554
Mari bertenang.

87
